# Data and published output are written by the Linux CI bot and only ever read
# by code. On a Windows checkout git would otherwise rewrite every line ending,
# so a plain `git pull` leaves thousands of lines showing as locally modified
# and it becomes very easy to commit that churn on top of real work.
*.csv       -text
*.json      -text
*.geojson   -text

# Keep the shell scripts and workflows LF regardless of platform.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
